<title>SYRIA: Syria tenders to buy 12,000 tonnes of rice.</title>
<headline>Syria tenders to buy 12,000 tonnes of rice.</headline>
<dateline>DAMASCUS 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syria's General Foreign Trade Organisation for Chemicals and Foostuffs (GEZA) has issued an international tender to buy 12,000 tonnes of white rice for shipment in March, a company spokesman said on Monday.</p>
<p>He told Reuters that February 3 had been set as the final date for offers.</p>
<p>Results of the tender would be announced on February 13, the official said.</p>
</text>
